{"5005510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "YOU MUST SLEEP: Ravenous Nightmares", "steam_appid": 5005510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU MUST SLEEP, yet monsters keep you awake!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like &quot;Five Nights at Freddy's 4&quot;, &quot;The Joy of Creation&quot;, and the FNAF series in general, &quot;YOU MUST SLEEP: Ravenous Nightmares&quot; will put you in the shoes of John, a man who would do anything to cure his insomnia, even dabbling in the occult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a mysterious site appears on John’s browser tabs, promising him a good night’s sleep as long as he attempts a strange ritual...He will soon find out that if something sounds too good to be true, it probably is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/3c17d092eaf84f0ecaf181cebfdd23c7.poster.avif?t=1788260699\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/3c17d092eaf84f0ecaf181cebfdd23c7.webm?t=1788260699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/3c17d092eaf84f0ecaf181cebfdd23c7.mp4?t=1788260699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVADE IMMORTAL MONSTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ immortal monsters will manifest when John tries to sleep, each with their own unique way of harming John. Listen for <strong>sound cues</strong>, keep your grip on the <strong>blanket,</strong> and hide under it if the monsters get too close to survive the night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/cde7c73a8c858a7e060ef933cf534c7b.poster.avif?t=1788260699\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/cde7c73a8c858a7e060ef933cf534c7b.webm?t=1788260699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/cde7c73a8c858a7e060ef933cf534c7b.mp4?t=1788260699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world still moves on, regardless of John's personal hell.  Manage various stats, such as <strong>STRESS</strong> and <strong>WARMTH,</strong> during the day to ensure the night proceeds as smoothly as possible. To survive the ritual, <strong>YOU</strong> <strong>MUST SLEEP</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/06c158935f09253e583a184d72678183.poster.avif?t=1788260699\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/06c158935f09253e583a184d72678183.webm?t=1788260699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/06c158935f09253e583a184d72678183.mp4?t=1788260699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use John's <strong>Laptop</strong> to access the mysterious occult site and learn more about the Sleep Sigil Ritual. Perhaps the admins know a thing or two about the monsters...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/33cfab610fefe97d0012e99425a46c46.poster.avif?t=1788260699\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/33cfab610fefe97d0012e99425a46c46.webm?t=1788260699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/33cfab610fefe97d0012e99425a46c46.mp4?t=1788260699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POST GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beating the campaign once will unlock various post-game modes, such as <strong>CUSTOM NIGHT</strong> and <strong>MARATHON</strong>, offering tons of replayability!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/a18c4bc7132080ee038375bdfe6c302f.webp?t=1788260699\" width=480 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU MUST SLEEP, yet monsters keep you awake!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by games like &quot;Five Nights at Freddy's 4&quot;, &quot;The Joy of Creation&quot;, and the FNAF series in general, &quot;YOU MUST SLEEP: Ravenous Nightmares&quot; will put you in the shoes of John, a man who would do anything to cure his insomnia, even dabbling in the occult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a mysterious site appears on John’s browser tabs, promising him a good night’s sleep as long as he attempts a strange ritual...He will soon find out that if something sounds too good to be true, it probably is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5005510/extras/3c17d092eaf84f0ecaf181cebfdd23c7.poster.avif?t=1788260699\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"h